    "Information-flow decoding: To investigate information flow between regions, we will implement generalized linear model (GLM) machine learning decoding to test whether ACC activity preceding ripples can predict CA1 activity during ripples. ACC spiking will be binned into 200ms segments across multiple time windows to predict individual CA1 neuronal firing rates between 0-100ms after ripple onset. For GLM decoding analysis, we will randomly partition ripples into training and testing datasets. The model derived from the training phase will be applied to ACC population spike data in the test set to yield predictions for CA1 spike counts across ripples. We will calculate prediction errors and compare real data performance to shuffled controls.": [
